        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "champ_0095_rival_04",
      "hash64": "FEF121A04EC9A659",
      "text": "啊，你可别误会！\\n我可不是想和你对战才追上来的……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "champ_0095_rival_05",
      "hash64": "FEF120A04EC9A4A6",
      "text": "不过，我确实有点\\n想和你对战就是啦～\\r\\n……可以吗？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
